### CampusQuest AI Assistant & Intelligence Tests

### 1. Get AI Personalized Recommendations
GET http://localhost:5000/ai/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. AI Concept Explainer
POST http://localhost:5000/ai/explain-concept
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "concept": "normalization",
    "subject_name": "Database Management Systems"
}

### 3. AI Wrong Answer Explainer
POST http://localhost:5000/ai/explain-wrong-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question_text": "A relation is in BCNF if for every functional dependency X -> Y:",
    "selected_answer": "A",
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "explanation": "BCNF requires that every determinant X must be a superkey."
}

### 4. Exam Intelligence Analysis
GET http://localhost:5000/ai/exam-intelligence/1
